F3 WH - wanted to share the backblast from @gigolo’s BD. @vector and YHC were there to represent F3WH and the day was special.

Would you please skim the BB 
and especially watch the video from @flintstone below.  Perhaps while brushing your teeth or driving but just listen to the heart of F3 and the impact this man had.

