147 men came out this morning on 08/01/26 to support the loss of our brother Gigolo.

We lined up, went through a quick word and got right into this 60 minute Beatdown
we went through our disclaimer our mission and quickly took a safety count.

We appointed 5 CPR Q's in each group and right at 0608 we went to our stations

Group 1 2chainz
Group 2 Stroke
Group 3 Hobo
Group 4 Sunflower
Group 5 Reaper and Cheech

each station did their own series of exercises- the station leaders were FTL to choose which exercises to do within some simple guidelines.

Station 1 Flintstone (Cindies)
Station 2 The Dean (Core)
Station 3 Morningwood (Full Body)
Station 4 Stinkbait (Sandbags)
Station 5 Jack Frost (11's)

Each station lasted 8 minutes with 2 minutes to move to the next stations
We came, we saw, and we conquered. Every rep was for Gigolo, and there’s no doubt he was looking down on us proud and honored - probably with a cigar in hand.

Time! we circled up for a count 147
and a quick Nameorama! (7 minutes and 40 seconds to be exact)

