I know the final rankings matter to all of the competitors, those really are the least important metrics from yesterday. Every one of us went beyond what we thought we could do, and also felt like we could improve as well. Just remember, this is a journey and the ride is the reward.

Next year, we will have to make some changes to things, which I welcome all feedback on (good and bad). This is event is for all of you and the better it is, the more hearts we get to heal.
